 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### New Features
+
+- Local JASS/vJASS support brings Classic Warcraft sources into the persistent graph, including declarations, callbacks and statically declared method receivers, with explicit limits for preprocessor expansion and dynamic calls.
+
+### Fixes
+
+- JASS/vJASS documentation regions and multiline strings no longer create false symbols or corrupt the scope of the code that follows them.
+- Calls from JASS/vJASS local initializers belong to the enclosing function, and unqualified struct methods resolve before same-named global functions.
+- MCP guidance now reflects automatic watching and catch-up for explicitly selected projects.
 
 ## [1.6.2] - 2026-10-03
 
